Subject: [PATCH 206/220] [ae-patch] Paste the exact note when an iPhone
 clipboard also carries its encoded URL copy

iOS puts the note on the clipboard as text/plain (exact) and text/uri-list (lowercased, percent-encoded) and its own paste inserts the encoded one, so the 0204 repair never saw it. Prefer text/plain when the URI list is the encoded note, which also keeps the capitals.
